          "requirement_id": "TFQM-CONTINUUM-REVIEW-DFM-CONTINUUM-INTERFACE-1"
        },
        {
          "requirement": "Own the complete bounded label dict, including unused entries, as a frozen aggregate over a read-only mapping of immutable rational matrices. Legacy validated_labels returns a new dict of immutable exported values.",
