        {
          "requirement": "Snapshot each signed word, require exact integer orientation+1/-1, validate names/step shape/budget and reject any unlabelled step before multiplication. Later factors stand on the left; negative orientation inverts the factor. Footprint is the set of validated names and needs no connection. Public aggregate path returns Outcome; legacy path_transport exports exact matrices.",
