          "requirement_id": "TFQM-CONTINUUM-REVIEW-DFM-CONTINUUM-INTERFACE-3"
        },
        {
          "requirement": "Admit only composable forward walks on the fixed four-edge graph, allowing any valid start vertex and the empty walk. Require all four labels for dressing. Use inverse target transport times edge label times source transport; keep a separate explicit chord formula. Fixed graph and root paths are immutable supplied data, not a spanning-tree proof.",
